      "id": "s1",
      "text": "But the night her grandmother fell asleep without finishing their story, Lina put on her red wool coat and walked across the frosty field to listen. The humming grew louder, a deep vibration that tickled her toes, and as she pressed her hand against the rough wood, a door—which she had never noticed before—swung open into the darkness."
    }
