{
  "bridge_text": "Mosk’s grumpy warning was meant to keep the world away, yet Lina stood her ground, sensing a deeper story hidden behind his tired eyes. She looked at the fox, waiting for him to decide if she would stay or go.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
